notes: Four founder-driven fixes from the latest device log + take. (1) rPPG NEVER LOCKED: exposure was frozen on a blind 2 s timer against the dim, finger-less scene, then saturated (R=0.82) when the fingertip arrived — swamping the pulsatile AC so bpm stayed 0 for minutes. Now exposure locks only AFTER the finger stably covers the torch-lit lens (~1.2 s), re-settles if a lock saturates, and re-locks on re-grip; the signal-quality SNR gate is now DC-relative (was an absolute window a bright fingertip always failed). DSP-reviewed. Verify: lock ~1–2 s after finger placement, R settles mid-range (~0.4–0.6) not 0.82, bpm appears. (2) LOCK BPM now adopts your live heart-rate tempo on enable instead of snapping to a stale value, so the take and the tempo-driven immersive circles stay continuous (no jump). (3) MASTER EQ retuned from an FFT of a real take (sub-dominated + dark, nothing above 8 kHz): HPF 45 Hz, low-shelf −1.5 dB@140 (tame boom), presence +2 dB@2.8k, air +3.5 dB@9k — clearer/brighter master; reversible via presets. (4) LIVE 5D MPE OUTPUT: opt-in ("5D Expression (body)", off by default) streams per-note Glide/Slide/Press out to any MPE rig; zero risk to the internal sound. Presets + composition refinement is the next pass, best tuned by ear AFTER this new master. PLUS immersive VISUAL PRESETS: a curated Aura→Zentrifuge set (9 named looks, softest→most energetic) in the Visual panel that load the live Intensity/Detail/Motion/Spread sliders + render mode — tap to launch, then play live; all flash-safe; colour stays the physically-correct tone→light mapping. Concurrency + DSP reviews PASS; iOS + CI gates green.
